   "kind": "added",
   "en_span": "chapters/tables_presentation.qmd:158-158",
   "tr_span": "chapters/tables_presentation.fr.qmd:153-153",
   "proposition": "The French defines CT values as \"seuil de cycle dans un test de detection du virus par PCR\" (cycle threshold in a PCR virus-detection test); the English sentence gives no definition of CT values.",
   "reader_consequence": "The French reader receives a substantive epidemiological definition that the English handbook does not state here, so the two versions differ in what the reader is told the ct_blood column measures, and the definition is not maintained alongside the English source.",
