  },
  {
   "heading": "Conditional formatting",
   "segment_index": "S14.P1",
   "kind": "added",
   "en_span": "chapters/tables_presentation.qmd:387-387",
   "tr_span": "chapters/tables_presentation.fr.qmd:379-379",
   "proposition": "The French opens with the claim that conditional formatting is one of flextable's strong points (\"L'un des points forts de **flextable** est qu'il nous permet de faire des mises en forme de notre table finale selon des conditions...\"); the English makes no evaluative claim about flextable's strengths in this segment.",
   "reader_consequence": "The French reader is given a package-comparison judgement the English does not make, which may lead them to choose flextable over knitr/DT/GT on a claimed advantage that the handbook never asserts.",
